The Woodstock Quarter store opened in March 2020, selling the brand''s small-batch flavours, including vegan and dairy options, from a dedicated shop unit on the ground level. It trades through the afternoon and early evening from Monday to Saturday. It suits dessert-lovers after adventurous, small-batch ice cream rather than a standard commercial tub.', source_urls = json_insert(CASE WHEN json_valid(source_urls) AND json_type(source_urls) = 'array' THEN source_urls ELSE '[]' END, '$[#]', 'https://www.woodstockquarter.co.za/tenant-directory/eateries/unframed-ice-cream'), description_enriched_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'unframed-ice-cream-woodstock' AND description = 'Unframed Ice Cream is an artisanal ice-cream maker in the Woodstock Quarter on Sir Lowry Road, known for adventurous small-batch flavours, including vegan and dairy options such as blue coconut and dirty milk chocolate.' AND description_enriched_at IS NULL AND length(COALESCE(description, '')) < 700
